<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One Finl started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One Finl started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch started coverage of Capital One Financial Corp with near-term accumulate and long-term buy, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 30-7/8.</p>
</text>
